# Which Cloudflare account this directory deploys to. wrangler has one login
# for the whole machine and the directory tells it nothing, so without this a
# deploy run here goes wherever that login points — which is somebody else's
# account. Holds an identifier, not a credential, and is not committed anyway.
.env
*.log
.DS_Store
